data: {"id": "df77e8b6d06b4fb7-thinking-layer-328", "run_id": "df77e8b6d06b4fb7", "node": "layer", "node_name": "问题定位", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "**当前异常定位**\n\n集群中存在 1 个异常实体：\n*   **异常 Pod**: `aiops-case-v09/workload`\n*   **当前状态**: `CrashLoopBackOff` (重启 6 次)\n*   **异常类型**: `CrashLoopBackOffRuntime`\n\n该 Pod 处于反复崩溃重启状态。由于 `CrashLoopBackOff` 可能由多种原因触发（如应用报错退出、配置错误、内存溢出 OOMKilled 或探针误杀），我已获取 `pod-crashloop-runtime.md` 和 `pod-oomkilled.md` 作为诊断参考。\n\n下一步需获取 Pod 的详细状态（`kubectl describe`）以确认 `Last State`（是否有 OOMKilled 证据）及 `Exit Code`，从而将异常类型收敛为更具体的根因（如 OOMKilled、配置缺失或应用运行时错误）。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1789136384243}

